# Website Directory

- `Website/` is intentionally excluded from git via `.gitignore`.
- Do not treat ignored files under `Website/` as accidental, and do not suggest changing ignore rules or force-adding them unless the user explicitly asks.
- It is still valid to edit `Website/` files when requested; just note that those edits are local/private unless the user handles them separately.
